#: ../pythonpath/openpilot/selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/toggles.py
msgid "Standard is recommended. In aggressive mode, sunnypilot will follow lead cars closer and be more aggressive with the gas and brake. In relaxed mode sunnypilot will stay further away from lead cars. On supported cars, you can cycle through these personalities with your steering wheel distance button."
msgstr "推荐使用标准。激进模式下 sunnypilot 会更贴近前车，油门与刹车更果断。轻松模式会与前车保持更远距离。在支持的车型上，可用方向盘车距按钮循环切换这些风格。"

#: ../pythonpath/openpilot/selfdrive/ui/sunnypilot/layouts/settings/models.py
